#~ msgid "Getting Involved"
#~ msgstr "Participación"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "There are many ways that you can get involved with the continued "
#~ "development of &digikam;. You do not need to be a software developer. You "
#~ "can help with documentation, translation and user interface design or "
#~ "just contribute really good ideas to the wish-list. You can also get "
#~ "involved by testing early development code as it is being developed and "
#~ "providing feedback to the developers. Of course, if you are a software "
#~ "developer then you can help to make &digikam; the best digital photograph "
#~ "application there is."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Hai moitas maneiras de participar no desenvolvemento continuado do "
#~ "&digikam;. Non hai por que ser un programador. Pódese axudar coa "
#~ "documentación, a tradución e o deseño da interface de usuario ou "
#~ "simplemente aportar boas ideas á lista de desexos. Tamén se pode "
#~ "participar probando as primeiras versións do código en desenvolvemento "
#~ "segundo se vai creando e aportándolles opinións aos programadores. Por "
#~ "suposto, se sabe programar pode axudar a que o &digikam; sexa o mellor "
#~ "aplicativo de fotografía dixital que existe."

